    reading: ['Stephen F. Teiser, "The Ghost Festival in Medieval China" (1988)', 'Michael Dylan Foster, "The Book of Yōkai" (2015)', 'J. J. M. de Groot, "The Religious System of China" (1892–1910)'],
    note: 'Ask which category a being belongs to in its own language before calling it a demon.',
