    reading: ['Walter W. Skeat, "Malay Magic" (1900)', 'Phya Anuman Rajadhon, "Essays on Thai Folklore" (1968)', 'Maximo D. Ramos, "The Creatures of Philippine Lower Mythology" (1971)'],
    note: 'Regional names differ and so do the beings; treat each local tradition on its own terms.',
